 so much to the  YC partners and thank you to everyone  okay I have a couple thank you so I  wanted to thank you all for coming today  and I hope you'll you know stay in touch  with us and let us know what you're  working on and stay in touch with each  other so a couple things I want to thank  you to Google for hosting the kickoff  dinner last night and to Silicon Valley  Bank for hosting the brunch this morning  I'm one piece of feedback we always get  from folks that attend is that they  don't have enough time to sort of meet  the other attendees so thank you for  doing that I also wanted to let you know  that AWS Amazon Web Services and Google  cloud are both offering hosting credits  to everyone here so keep an eye out for  an email for me I'll email you all sort  of instructions on how to take  advantages of those if you need or want  them and then I also wanted to thank the  riveter for hosting us because this is  an incredible space and I wanted to  thank Abney from poppy because she's one  of the major reasons we're here she was  such a big advocate  she's like constantly telling us how  many talented women there are in Seattle  so thank you  and one last thing is I wanted to well  two last things one is and we have  phenomenal women t-shirts for everyone  here so make sure to pick one up on your  way out and they are a non-profit you  can check them out there they're an  incredible organization and so remember  to get those before you head to the  reception at Red Hook brew lab down the  street and then also my last last thing  is I wanted to thank everyone at YC ya  who made this happen there's like ten of  us who came out especially Dom Dominic  finds who heads up events for YC so you  did an incredible job and thank you  [Applause]  Red Hook brew lab we will see you there  any anything else you use your badges  was that  [Applause]
 

